1
00:01:36,940 --> 00:01:38,880
[The Lament of Autumn]

2
00:01:39,440 --> 00:01:41,500
[Episode 5]

3
00:01:48,060 --> 00:01:48,560
Please.

4
00:01:56,920 --> 00:02:00,590
-Take care, Fifth Young Master Yu.
-Take care, Fifth Young Master Yu.

5
00:02:00,590 --> 00:02:01,290
Let's go.

6
00:02:02,590 --> 00:02:04,040
Where did they go last night?

7
00:02:04,040 --> 00:02:05,300
Do you even need to ask?

8
00:02:05,350 --> 00:02:07,950
Only Fifth Young Master Yu
could pull that off.

9
00:02:10,930 --> 00:02:12,190
Second Young Lady Tao.

10
00:02:13,080 --> 00:02:14,340
Second Young Lady Tao.

11
00:02:17,530 --> 00:02:18,590
Why are you crying?

12
00:02:20,560 --> 00:02:21,430
You two talk.

13
00:02:21,740 --> 00:02:23,270
I'll wait for you in the car.

14
00:02:27,030 --> 00:02:29,030
Is this about Fifth Young Master Yu?

15
00:02:30,740 --> 00:02:31,070
Come.

16
00:02:31,710 --> 00:02:32,910
Let's talk over here.

17
00:02:37,250 --> 00:02:40,650
Don't you think Fifth Young Master Yu's
been acting strange?

18
00:02:42,630 --> 00:02:43,560
In the end,

19
00:02:44,800 --> 00:02:46,190
it's all because of you.

20
00:02:49,010 --> 00:02:50,610
Just say what you want to say.

21
00:02:52,210 --> 00:02:52,800
Okay.

22
00:02:53,310 --> 00:02:53,930
Look,

23
00:02:54,840 --> 00:02:56,150
girls like Miss Ye,

24
00:02:56,800 --> 00:02:58,060
who are unpretentious

25
00:02:58,250 --> 00:02:59,400
and obedient,

26
00:02:59,480 --> 00:03:01,680
are the best at capturing a man's heart.

27
00:03:02,560 --> 00:03:03,660
What do you mean?

28
00:03:04,190 --> 00:03:05,720
Asking me to be submissive?

29
00:03:05,750 --> 00:03:07,030
I could never do that.

30
00:03:07,630 --> 00:03:08,860
That's not what I mean.

31
00:03:08,860 --> 00:03:10,190
It comes in many forms.

32
00:03:10,360 --> 00:03:11,860
For example,

33
00:03:12,560 --> 00:03:14,090
catering to his interests.

34
00:03:14,400 --> 00:03:16,400
That's a higher form of tenderness.

35
00:03:16,710 --> 00:03:17,750
Make the man believe

36
00:03:17,750 --> 00:03:18,960
that you are the woman

37
00:03:19,030 --> 00:03:20,720
who understands him better
than anyone in the world.

38
00:03:20,720 --> 00:03:21,410
Look,

39
00:03:22,020 --> 00:03:23,280
at Fifth Young Master Yu's
birthday party yesterday,

40
00:03:23,280 --> 00:03:24,310
he said he liked

41
00:03:24,310 --> 00:03:25,400
Miss Ye's gift the most.

42
00:03:25,400 --> 00:03:26,579
Actually, he didn't like

43
00:03:26,579 --> 00:03:27,440
anyone's gift.

44
00:03:28,180 --> 00:03:29,370
Think about the Yu family—

45
00:03:29,370 --> 00:03:30,540
vast fortune, great power.

46
00:03:30,540 --> 00:03:32,400
What good things doesn't he have?

47
00:03:32,690 --> 00:03:33,300
But,

48
00:03:33,750 --> 00:03:34,930
if there's something

49
00:03:34,930 --> 00:03:36,590
that truly touches his heart,

50
00:03:37,400 --> 00:03:39,730
the effect will definitely be different.

51
00:03:42,000 --> 00:03:42,930
Then tell me,

52
00:03:43,470 --> 00:03:44,520
what kind of gift

53
00:03:44,520 --> 00:03:45,740
can touch his heart?

54
00:03:47,340 --> 00:03:48,800
I have to think about this.

55
00:03:49,250 --> 00:03:50,300
What could it be?

56
00:03:55,750 --> 00:03:57,210
There really is one thing.

57
00:03:57,690 --> 00:03:58,500
He really likes it,

58
00:03:58,500 --> 00:04:00,190
but it hasn't been realized yet.

59
00:04:00,190 --> 00:04:01,120
Tell me quickly.

60
00:04:02,010 --> 00:04:03,500
I-I also happened to hear

61
00:04:03,500 --> 00:04:04,710
him mention it in passing.

62
00:04:04,710 --> 00:04:06,570
He thinks this place is too small.

63
00:04:06,620 --> 00:04:07,340
He wants to build

64
00:04:07,340 --> 00:04:08,930
a far more luxurious racecourse,

65
00:04:08,930 --> 00:04:10,590
ten times the size of this one.

66
00:04:11,130 --> 00:04:13,340
Somewhere like Shuangqiao Town,

67
00:04:14,400 --> 00:04:15,120
Yanxi Lake,

68
00:04:15,250 --> 00:04:16,860
or Changping Mountain.

69
00:04:22,220 --> 00:04:24,250
Push harder, we're almost there.

70
00:04:32,510 --> 00:04:33,100
Move!

71
00:04:33,630 --> 00:04:34,390
Move away!

72
00:04:35,560 --> 00:04:37,860
The soldiers are coming. Make way.

73
00:04:38,560 --> 00:04:39,800
Mother!

74
00:04:50,100 --> 00:04:50,690
Hurry up.

75
00:04:50,710 --> 00:04:52,050
Commander-in-Chief Yu is waiting for me.

76
00:04:52,050 --> 00:04:52,760
Hya!

77
00:04:52,780 --> 00:04:53,250
Hya!

78
00:04:53,270 --> 00:04:53,870
Hya!

79
00:04:53,890 --> 00:04:54,960
-Hya!
-Hya!

80
00:04:54,990 --> 00:04:57,290
-Hya!
-Hya!

81
00:04:59,500 --> 00:05:03,310
[Nanhuai Army Headquarters]

82
00:05:01,810 --> 00:05:02,870
Third Master Cheng has convened

83
00:05:02,870 --> 00:05:05,010
a multi‑province alliance conference
in Huaijing.

84
00:05:05,010 --> 00:05:06,000
Soon we will know

85
00:05:06,000 --> 00:05:07,370
whether he or Premier Rui

86
00:05:07,310 --> 00:05:16,930
[Yu]

87
00:05:07,620 --> 00:05:10,220
will take control of
the Presidential Palace.

88
00:05:13,130 --> 00:05:15,010
The date for our allied forces

89
00:05:15,010 --> 00:05:17,270
with Military Governor Chu has been set.

90
00:05:18,330 --> 00:05:20,480
We will fully support Third Master Cheng.

91
00:05:20,480 --> 00:05:21,250
But

92
00:05:21,540 --> 00:05:23,630
Military Governor Chu is deploying

93
00:05:23,630 --> 00:05:24,740
our Yu Army's

94
00:05:24,740 --> 00:05:26,890
elite Ninth Army for this mission.

95
00:05:27,770 --> 00:05:29,370
Since it's already decided,

96
00:05:30,450 --> 00:05:31,900
let's just do our best.

97
00:05:37,240 --> 00:05:37,900
Commander.

98
00:05:38,130 --> 00:05:40,190
Brigade Commander Feng has arrived.

99
00:05:40,480 --> 00:05:41,540
[Yu]

100
00:05:41,790 --> 00:05:42,680
Zhongquan!

101
00:05:43,000 --> 00:05:43,850
[Yu]

102
00:05:43,650 --> 00:05:45,680
Feng the Bold.

103
00:05:45,800 --> 00:05:46,510
Zhongquan.

104
00:05:46,510 --> 00:05:49,440
-I've been waiting for you.
-I've missed you so much.

105
00:05:50,060 --> 00:05:52,240
Long time no see.
You look even more robust.

106
00:05:52,240 --> 00:05:53,310
Bandits that others couldn't crack

107
00:05:53,310 --> 00:05:54,510
in two or three years,

108
00:05:54,720 --> 00:05:56,240
Brigade Commander Feng wiped them all out

109
00:05:56,240 --> 00:05:57,450
in just half a year.

110
00:05:57,800 --> 00:05:58,630
You've worked hard and achieved a lot.

111
00:05:58,630 --> 00:05:59,290
Zhongquan.

112
00:05:59,930 --> 00:06:00,600
Guess

113
00:06:01,370 --> 00:06:02,060
what good stuff

114
00:06:02,060 --> 00:06:03,100
I brought you.

115
00:06:03,540 --> 00:06:04,180
What?

116
00:06:04,180 --> 00:06:04,620
Look.

117
00:06:05,070 --> 00:06:06,390
Top-grade Fenjiu.

118
00:06:06,690 --> 00:06:07,390
Good stuff.

119
00:06:07,390 --> 00:06:09,390
Tonight let's drink until we drop.

120
00:06:09,450 --> 00:06:09,920
Okay.

121
00:06:10,300 --> 00:06:10,860
At my place,

122
00:06:10,860 --> 00:06:12,160
-or here?
-Brigade Commander Feng.

123
00:06:12,160 --> 00:06:14,500
The Commander is having a meeting with us.

124
00:06:21,570 --> 00:06:23,190
You people keep pestering my brother

125
00:06:23,190 --> 00:06:24,790
with meeting after meeting.

126
00:06:25,890 --> 00:06:26,720
I wonder,

127
00:06:27,240 --> 00:06:28,770
can meetings and paperwork

128
00:06:29,860 --> 00:06:31,660
pacify the realm?

129
00:06:34,010 --> 00:06:36,010
If you were sent to the battlefield,

130
00:06:36,390 --> 00:06:37,070
I think

131
00:06:37,070 --> 00:06:39,510
you'd be so scared

132
00:06:39,770 --> 00:06:41,810
that you'd shit your pants.

133
00:06:48,220 --> 00:06:49,020
Feng the Bold.

134
00:06:49,920 --> 00:06:50,580
Zhongquan.

135
00:06:54,420 --> 00:06:55,950
This brother of mine, Feng,

136
00:06:56,870 --> 00:06:58,860
has followed me for over twenty years,

137
00:06:58,860 --> 00:07:00,190
through life and death.

138
00:07:00,920 --> 00:07:03,720
His body bears countless scars
and bullet wounds.

139
00:07:04,890 --> 00:07:07,070
But he just can't get rid of

140
00:07:07,330 --> 00:07:08,560
that bandit streak.

141
00:07:11,270 --> 00:07:12,420
Please forgive him.

142
00:07:14,440 --> 00:07:16,370
You should go change your clothes.

143
00:07:17,270 --> 00:07:20,120
I can already smell a stench.

144
00:07:24,040 --> 00:07:24,570
Let's go.

145
00:07:25,230 --> 00:07:25,980
All right.

146
00:07:33,010 --> 00:07:34,330
Our Fifth Young Master

147
00:07:34,330 --> 00:07:35,370
is finally awake.

148
00:07:35,570 --> 00:07:37,750
You didn't wake up
even with such a loud noise.

149
00:07:37,750 --> 00:07:39,060
You slept like a log.

150
00:07:39,390 --> 00:07:40,390
Morning, Mother.

151
00:07:42,600 --> 00:07:43,620
Changxuan, you are awake.

152
00:07:43,620 --> 00:07:45,550
Try this freshly made walnut cake.

153
00:07:46,010 --> 00:07:47,659
No military duties today?

154
00:07:48,950 --> 00:07:50,750
You're making fun of me, Jinxuan.

155
00:07:50,750 --> 00:07:51,560
Father only sent me

156
00:07:51,560 --> 00:07:53,630
to gain experience with the Ninth Army.

157
00:07:53,630 --> 00:07:54,230
Right now,

158
00:07:54,420 --> 00:07:55,130
no important matters

159
00:07:55,130 --> 00:07:55,920
fall on my shoulders.

160
00:07:55,920 --> 00:07:57,380
Going there is pointless.

161
00:08:01,500 --> 00:08:02,900
For this birthday party,

162
00:08:03,160 --> 00:08:05,290
you invited the Second Young Lady Tao.

163
00:08:05,330 --> 00:08:06,660
How are things progressing

164
00:08:06,660 --> 00:08:08,160
between you two?

165
00:08:09,860 --> 00:08:11,990
Everyone I invited were just friends.

166
00:08:12,060 --> 00:08:13,750
The Fifth Young Master's friends

167
00:08:13,750 --> 00:08:16,560
are like actors putting on a grand show.

168
00:08:16,770 --> 00:08:19,300
As one leaves the stage, another enters.

169
00:08:19,630 --> 00:08:20,870
One is sent away,

170
00:08:20,890 --> 00:08:22,490
and another is about to come.

171
00:08:22,570 --> 00:08:24,950
Mother, you don't need to worry about him.

172
00:08:25,560 --> 00:08:26,920
Look at Young Marshal Xiao

173
00:08:26,920 --> 00:08:27,770
from Beixin.

174
00:08:28,570 --> 00:08:30,100
He personally led the troops

175
00:08:30,100 --> 00:08:31,860
and won the battle at Huyang Pass.

176
00:08:31,860 --> 00:08:33,130
He even won with fewer troops,

177
00:08:33,130 --> 00:08:34,909
taking Yuhua and Tonglin.

178
00:08:34,960 --> 00:08:37,169
Three battles, three victories—
his fame shakes the north.

179
00:08:37,169 --> 00:08:38,370
Now look at yourself.

180
00:08:38,460 --> 00:08:40,100
You are only a year or two
younger than him,

181
00:08:40,100 --> 00:08:40,870
yet the gap between you

182
00:08:40,870 --> 00:08:42,250
is enormous.

183
00:08:42,480 --> 00:08:43,880
It seems our sixth sister

184
00:08:43,940 --> 00:08:44,870
has fallen for this guy

185
00:08:44,870 --> 00:08:46,050
named Xiao.

186
00:08:47,530 --> 00:08:48,990
Since you like him so much,

187
00:08:49,000 --> 00:08:49,840
why don't we arrange a marriage

188
00:08:49,840 --> 00:08:51,040
with the Xiao family?

189
00:08:51,050 --> 00:08:52,180
That would be great.

190
00:08:52,550 --> 00:08:53,460
But I heard

191
00:08:54,220 --> 00:08:54,740
that within their residence

192
00:08:54,740 --> 00:08:55,960
lives a young lady.

193
00:08:56,360 --> 00:08:58,090
I wonder if he'd even fancy you.

194
00:08:59,530 --> 00:09:00,530
Yu Changxuan.

195
00:09:00,960 --> 00:09:03,400
You really know how to touch a sore spot.

196
00:09:03,790 --> 00:09:05,010
Alright, alright.

197
00:09:05,480 --> 00:09:07,270
Whenever you two meet,

198
00:09:07,370 --> 00:09:09,360
you start bickering.

199
00:09:11,870 --> 00:09:12,670
Changxuan.

200
00:09:13,360 --> 00:09:14,360
If you

201
00:09:14,360 --> 00:09:16,910
truly have feelings
for Second Young Lady Tao,

202
00:09:16,910 --> 00:09:18,640
it's better to settle it early.

203
00:09:18,880 --> 00:09:23,980
[Huai Daily]

204
00:09:19,550 --> 00:09:20,720
No wonder people say

205
00:09:20,870 --> 00:09:22,270
that any female relative

206
00:09:22,500 --> 00:09:24,250
loves to play matchmaker.

207
00:09:25,050 --> 00:09:25,910
They can't stand the sight

208
00:09:25,910 --> 00:09:26,860
of a bachelor.

209
00:09:27,700 --> 00:09:28,700
Sounds like

210
00:09:29,240 --> 00:09:30,860
you haven't settled down yet.

211
00:09:30,860 --> 00:09:31,790
Changxuan,

212
00:09:32,080 --> 00:09:34,340
have you taken a fancy to some other girl?

213
00:09:44,240 --> 00:09:45,030
Could it be

214
00:09:45,390 --> 00:09:46,700
that she was right?

215
00:09:48,080 --> 00:09:49,140
Early in the morning,

216
00:09:49,140 --> 00:09:51,010
you sisters are so sharp-tongued.

217
00:09:49,190 --> 00:09:49,870
[Huai Daily]

218
00:09:52,410 --> 00:09:53,140
I'm leaving.

219
00:09:53,220 --> 00:09:54,000
Where are you going?

220
00:09:54,000 --> 00:09:55,080
The staff department.

221
00:09:55,080 --> 00:09:56,980
You're going to the staff department
dressed like that?

222
00:09:56,980 --> 00:09:58,110
Who are you fooling?

223
00:10:01,220 --> 00:10:02,480
None of your business.

224
00:10:03,360 --> 00:10:04,620
Then you'd better remind

225
00:10:04,620 --> 00:10:05,460
your driver

226
00:10:05,570 --> 00:10:07,220
not to accidentally drive to

227
00:10:07,220 --> 00:10:09,270
some Xiangxi Hotel or Yuchun Troupe again.

228
00:10:09,270 --> 00:10:11,120
We'd have quite the laugh then.

229
00:10:11,680 --> 00:10:13,410
[Yuchun Theater]

230
00:10:25,410 --> 00:10:26,250
Have you heard?

231
00:10:26,250 --> 00:10:27,580
Feng Daya wiped out

232
00:10:27,580 --> 00:10:29,270
over two thousand bandits
in one fell swoop.

233
00:10:29,270 --> 00:10:30,150
That old guy

234
00:10:30,290 --> 00:10:32,220
is the toast of the army again.

235
00:10:33,500 --> 00:10:35,390
The commander held a celebration
for him yesterday.

236
00:10:35,390 --> 00:10:36,720
My dad took me along too.

237
00:10:36,750 --> 00:10:38,890
That guy is so arrogant.

238
00:10:39,130 --> 00:10:40,100
My dad offered him a toast,

239
00:10:40,100 --> 00:10:41,760
and he pretended not to see it.

240
00:10:41,890 --> 00:10:43,150
Isn't he always like that?

241
00:10:43,150 --> 00:10:44,100
Fortunately my father is wise,

242
00:10:44,100 --> 00:10:45,100
he did not even go.

243
00:10:45,580 --> 00:10:46,220
Yesterday,

244
00:10:46,220 --> 00:10:47,360
I went riding in Qingshui Town.

245
00:10:47,360 --> 00:10:48,220
On the way back,

246
00:10:48,250 --> 00:10:49,700
a crowd of refugees swarmed my car,

247
00:10:49,700 --> 00:10:50,650
begging for food.

248
00:10:50,650 --> 00:10:51,550
I didn't bring any guards.

249
00:10:51,550 --> 00:10:52,750
It scared me to death.

250
00:10:52,750 --> 00:10:54,810
Are you still listening to the opera?

251
00:11:00,480 --> 00:11:01,630
I have to say,

252
00:11:01,720 --> 00:11:02,820
that little girl Ye Pingjun

253
00:11:02,820 --> 00:11:04,220
has proven quite useful.

254
00:11:04,270 --> 00:11:05,860
But you really should thank her properly.

255
00:11:05,860 --> 00:11:08,060
She suffered a lot because of your mess.

256
00:11:08,460 --> 00:11:09,390
What do you mean?

257
00:11:09,750 --> 00:11:11,390
I just came from Master Jin's place.

258
00:11:11,390 --> 00:11:11,940
I heard

259
00:11:11,940 --> 00:11:12,600
they are sending medicine over

260
00:11:12,600 --> 00:11:13,550
for Ye Pingjun.

261
00:11:13,890 --> 00:11:15,000
It seems

262
00:11:15,370 --> 00:11:17,700
she's running a high fever and took leave.

263
00:11:18,030 --> 00:11:18,870
If you hadn't kept her

264
00:11:18,870 --> 00:11:19,790
on that boat with you

265
00:11:19,790 --> 00:11:20,720
the whole night,

266
00:11:20,750 --> 00:11:22,550
would she have fallen ill, right?

267
00:11:22,550 --> 00:11:23,250
Bravo!

268
00:11:23,250 --> 00:11:24,510
Bravo!

269
00:11:24,600 --> 00:11:26,130
Bravo!

270
00:11:26,240 --> 00:11:27,130
Well sung!

271
00:11:41,770 --> 00:11:45,170
[Voluntary Pledge: Ye Pingjun]

272
00:11:41,890 --> 00:11:43,340
I will cooperate with you,

273
00:11:43,340 --> 00:11:44,720
but our contract period

274
00:11:45,240 --> 00:11:47,010
can't just be reduced by half a year.

275
00:11:47,010 --> 00:11:48,030
After it's done,

276
00:11:48,630 --> 00:11:50,460
you must return the contract to me.

277
00:11:50,460 --> 00:11:51,340
Seven.

278
00:11:52,250 --> 00:11:53,270
Eight.

279
00:11:54,150 --> 00:11:55,170
Nine.

280
00:11:59,050 --> 00:11:59,740
Ten.

281
00:12:27,590 --> 00:12:29,060
She's just a little girl.

282
00:12:53,150 --> 00:12:53,820
Hello.

283
00:12:54,650 --> 00:12:56,180
Is this Ye Pingjun's house?

284
00:12:56,870 --> 00:12:58,220
Yes, I'm her mother.

285
00:12:58,220 --> 00:12:59,600
May I ask who you are?

286
00:12:59,770 --> 00:13:00,650
Good day, Mrs. Ye.

287
00:13:00,650 --> 00:13:01,580
My surname is Yu.

288
00:13:01,700 --> 00:13:03,240
I'm Pingjun's colleague.

289
00:13:03,740 --> 00:13:04,550
I heard she was sick,

290
00:13:04,550 --> 00:13:05,750
so I came to visit her.

291
00:13:06,440 --> 00:13:08,580
Thank you for taking care of Pingjun.

292
00:13:09,170 --> 00:13:10,230
It is only natural.

293
00:13:10,340 --> 00:13:11,670
The boss instructed us—

294
00:13:12,050 --> 00:13:13,710
these cordyceps and ginseng,

295
00:13:13,740 --> 00:13:15,360
whether boiled or steeped in water,

296
00:13:15,360 --> 00:13:16,840
can nourish the lungs.

297
00:13:17,010 --> 00:13:18,050
I heard from Pingjun

298
00:13:18,050 --> 00:13:19,870
that your lungs haven't been well.

299
00:13:19,870 --> 00:13:21,600
You could drink some occasionally.

300
00:13:21,600 --> 00:13:23,320
You are too kind.

301
00:13:23,410 --> 00:13:25,240
But these gifts are too valuable.

302
00:13:25,240 --> 00:13:26,410
We can't accept them.

303
00:13:26,410 --> 00:13:27,240
Please take them back.

304
00:13:27,240 --> 00:13:28,070
It's okay.

305
00:13:28,340 --> 00:13:30,270
Just a token of the boss's regards.

306
00:13:32,670 --> 00:13:33,320
Pingjun.

307
00:13:34,080 --> 00:13:35,130
Why are you here?

308
00:13:35,620 --> 00:13:37,150
The boss is very concerned about

309
00:13:37,150 --> 00:13:38,530
how you're doing with your illness,

310
00:13:38,530 --> 00:13:40,270
so he sent me to pay a visit.

311
00:13:45,010 --> 00:13:46,980
The boss is really thoughtful.

312
00:13:47,220 --> 00:13:49,120
If he didn't like to cause trouble,

313
00:13:49,120 --> 00:13:50,720
I wouldn't have gotten sick.

314
00:13:53,010 --> 00:13:54,320
Watch your mouth.

315
00:13:54,940 --> 00:13:55,700
Mr. Yu,

316
00:13:55,770 --> 00:13:57,080
please don't mind her.

317
00:13:57,480 --> 00:13:58,080
It's okay.

318
00:13:58,790 --> 00:14:00,400
I appreciate Miss Ye's

319
00:14:00,510 --> 00:14:02,310
straightforward personality.

320
00:14:08,200 --> 00:14:10,260
I'd love to invite you to stay for tea,

321
00:14:10,320 --> 00:14:11,820
but honestly,

322
00:14:11,820 --> 00:14:13,410
we don't have any good tea to offer.

323
00:14:13,410 --> 00:14:14,170
It's okay.

324
00:14:14,620 --> 00:14:16,350
I happen to be a little thirsty.

325
00:14:19,320 --> 00:14:20,080
Pingjun.

326
00:14:20,460 --> 00:14:21,740
Go brew a cup of tea

327
00:14:21,910 --> 00:14:22,820
for Mr. Yu. Quickly.

328
00:14:22,820 --> 00:14:23,370
No, I...

329
00:14:24,150 --> 00:14:25,910
Go quickly.

330
00:14:26,240 --> 00:14:27,030
Go.

331
00:14:31,080 --> 00:14:31,870
Go.

332
00:14:34,960 --> 00:14:35,340
Well,

333
00:14:35,440 --> 00:14:36,870
Mr. Yu, please come in.

334
00:14:39,720 --> 00:14:40,220
Come.

335
00:14:42,250 --> 00:14:43,710
Please have a seat, Mr. Yu.

336
00:14:53,720 --> 00:14:54,780
Thank you, Miss Ye.

337
00:14:56,360 --> 00:14:57,030
Pingjun.

338
00:14:57,740 --> 00:14:58,530
Sit down.

339
00:15:01,960 --> 00:15:03,720
It's just that we're a humble household.

340
00:15:03,720 --> 00:15:05,460
I'm afraid we can't host you well.

341
00:15:05,460 --> 00:15:07,010
Mr. Yu, please have some tea.

342
00:15:07,010 --> 00:15:07,740
Not at all.

343
00:15:08,440 --> 00:15:10,700
I can tell your family is one of scholars.

344
00:15:11,000 --> 00:15:11,630
You even sent Miss Ye

345
00:15:11,630 --> 00:15:13,030
to Mingde Girls' School.

346
00:15:13,390 --> 00:15:14,790
It's obvious that
you place great importance

347
00:15:14,790 --> 00:15:16,520
on your daughter's education.

348
00:15:20,240 --> 00:15:21,860
So hypocritical.

349
00:15:24,220 --> 00:15:24,840
Mrs. Ye.

350
00:15:26,360 --> 00:15:28,170
I smelled something delicious
as soon as I walked in.

351
00:15:28,170 --> 00:15:29,100
Are you cooking?

352
00:15:29,520 --> 00:15:31,830
Yes, it should be ready soon.

353
00:15:32,870 --> 00:15:33,980
It's just a simple meal.

354
00:15:33,980 --> 00:15:35,820
Mr. Yu, if you don't mind,

355
00:15:35,940 --> 00:15:36,510
please stay

356
00:15:36,510 --> 00:15:38,110
and join us for a casual meal.

357
00:15:38,500 --> 00:15:39,960
With your busy schedule,

358
00:15:39,960 --> 00:15:40,860
Mr. Yu,

359
00:15:41,250 --> 00:15:41,940
I imagine you hardly have time

360
00:15:41,940 --> 00:15:42,720
to stay here.

361
00:15:43,050 --> 00:15:43,940
What a coincidence.

362
00:15:43,940 --> 00:15:45,530
I have no other engagements today.

363
00:15:45,530 --> 00:15:47,410
I came specifically to see Miss Ye.

364
00:15:47,410 --> 00:15:49,070
I never expected such a treat.

365
00:15:49,370 --> 00:15:51,010
Thank you for having me.

366
00:15:51,340 --> 00:15:52,410
Not at all.

367
00:15:52,510 --> 00:15:53,710
It will be ready soon.

368
00:16:04,240 --> 00:16:04,840
You—

369
00:16:05,820 --> 00:16:07,080
think of an excuse now.

370
00:16:07,080 --> 00:16:08,740
Say you can't stay for dinner.

371
00:16:08,790 --> 00:16:09,410
Get out.

372
00:16:10,980 --> 00:16:12,220
You're kicking me out?

373
00:16:12,220 --> 00:16:13,320
Isn't it obvious?

374
00:16:18,130 --> 00:16:19,650
Then it seems Miss Ye

375
00:16:21,170 --> 00:16:23,010
doesn't want this anymore.

376
00:16:23,170 --> 00:16:24,900
[Voluntary Pledge: Ye Pingjun]

377
00:16:27,660 --> 00:16:29,790
[Apprentice or Trainee: Ye Pingjun]

378
00:16:35,840 --> 00:16:37,720
I don't believe you'd be so kind.

379
00:16:40,250 --> 00:16:41,530
I saw you were sick

380
00:16:42,750 --> 00:16:44,840
and came specifically to bring it to you.

381
00:16:44,840 --> 00:16:46,970
If you don't want it, I'll take it back.

382
00:17:22,420 --> 00:17:23,310
I keep my word.

383
00:17:24,810 --> 00:17:25,609
From today on,

384
00:17:26,420 --> 00:17:28,680
Xiangxi Hotel has nothing to do with you.

385
00:17:31,590 --> 00:17:33,250
Since I've got the agreement,

386
00:17:34,030 --> 00:17:35,290
Fifth Young Master Yu,

387
00:17:35,530 --> 00:17:36,860
please take your leave.

388
00:17:39,850 --> 00:17:41,910
Pingjun, come help me serve the food.

389
00:17:42,310 --> 00:17:43,920
Mrs. Ye, let me help you.

390
00:17:55,050 --> 00:17:55,720
Uncle.

391
00:17:58,830 --> 00:18:00,390
What brings

392
00:18:00,750 --> 00:18:01,750
our little princess

393
00:18:01,750 --> 00:18:02,640
here today?

394
00:18:03,420 --> 00:18:04,280
Uncle,

395
00:18:04,720 --> 00:18:05,880
every time you see me,

396
00:18:05,880 --> 00:18:07,310
you just make fun of me.

397
00:18:09,110 --> 00:18:09,920
Tell me.

398
00:18:10,330 --> 00:18:10,880
This time,

399
00:18:10,880 --> 00:18:12,310
what good stuff have you set your eyes on

400
00:18:12,310 --> 00:18:13,970
that you want me to buy for you?

401
00:18:14,420 --> 00:18:15,680
Really, Uncle.

402
00:18:15,850 --> 00:18:17,480
Can't I just miss you?

403
00:18:18,380 --> 00:18:20,550
I even came all the way here to see you.

404
00:18:20,700 --> 00:18:21,980
In that little head of yours,

405
00:18:21,980 --> 00:18:22,810
I know exactly

406
00:18:22,810 --> 00:18:24,240
what's going on.

407
00:18:24,810 --> 00:18:25,920
I have watched you

408
00:18:25,920 --> 00:18:27,420
grow into a young lady.

409
00:18:29,880 --> 00:18:31,010
Actually,

410
00:18:31,270 --> 00:18:32,940
I have come to ask you

411
00:18:33,480 --> 00:18:34,660
for something.

412
00:18:35,160 --> 00:18:37,500
Is it rubies, emeralds,

413
00:18:37,940 --> 00:18:39,530
or a mink coat this time?

414
00:18:39,680 --> 00:18:40,400
Neither.

415
00:18:41,200 --> 00:18:42,200
I have my eye on your land

416
00:18:42,200 --> 00:18:43,530
in Changping Mountain.

417
00:18:45,770 --> 00:18:47,030
Changping Mountain?

418
00:18:50,960 --> 00:18:52,090
That will be tricky.

419
00:18:52,790 --> 00:18:53,980
I've already agreed

420
00:18:53,980 --> 00:18:54,740
to sell it

421
00:18:55,200 --> 00:18:56,330
to Tongbao Company.

422
00:18:56,830 --> 00:18:59,680
An agreement is not yet a signed contract.

423
00:19:00,010 --> 00:19:00,700
Just tell them

424
00:19:00,700 --> 00:19:02,430
you're not selling it anymore.

425
00:19:02,880 --> 00:19:05,990
Please say yes.

426
00:19:06,160 --> 00:19:09,050
Uncle, uncle, uncle.

427
00:19:10,440 --> 00:19:12,300
These are just some light dishes.

428
00:19:12,350 --> 00:19:13,030
Mr. Yu,

429
00:19:13,110 --> 00:19:14,350
please don't mind.

430
00:19:14,640 --> 00:19:15,770
It's already quite a feast.

431
00:19:15,770 --> 00:19:16,310
Besides,

432
00:19:16,830 --> 00:19:17,740
only light food

433
00:19:18,110 --> 00:19:20,040
can bring out its original flavor.

434
00:19:20,740 --> 00:19:21,740
Then have a taste.

435
00:19:22,070 --> 00:19:23,130
After you, Mrs. Ye.

436
00:19:23,940 --> 00:19:24,550
Okay.

437
00:19:36,070 --> 00:19:37,570
So delicate and delicious,

438
00:19:37,570 --> 00:19:39,170
the flavor lingers on and on.

439
00:19:39,440 --> 00:19:41,250
Mrs. Ye, you're such a great cook.

440
00:19:41,250 --> 00:19:43,250
Eat more if you like it.

441
00:19:49,810 --> 00:19:51,550
Then try that one.

442
00:19:51,750 --> 00:19:52,350
That is...

443
00:19:52,440 --> 00:19:53,060
Mother,

444
00:19:53,320 --> 00:19:54,980
let me serve you a bowl of soup.

445
00:19:56,010 --> 00:19:56,680
Mr. Yu.

446
00:19:56,810 --> 00:19:58,640
Actually, that one is also delicious.

447
00:19:58,640 --> 00:19:59,850
It has glutinous rice on the outside,

448
00:19:59,850 --> 00:20:01,160
with minced meat filling inside.

449
00:20:01,160 --> 00:20:02,250
-Most importantly...
-Mother.

450
00:20:02,250 --> 00:20:03,210
Drink it while it's hot.

451
00:20:03,210 --> 00:20:04,110
Okay.

452
00:20:04,500 --> 00:20:05,290
Then serve Mr. Yu

453
00:20:05,290 --> 00:20:06,440
a bowl of soup too.

454
00:20:19,180 --> 00:20:20,240
Thank you, Miss Ye.

455
00:20:32,960 --> 00:20:36,480
Finish it and leave quickly.

456
00:20:42,050 --> 00:20:43,380
No wonder my mother said

457
00:20:43,810 --> 00:20:45,340
daughters are very caring.

458
00:20:45,680 --> 00:20:48,160
Seeing the loving bond between you two

459
00:20:48,660 --> 00:20:50,240
really warms my heart.

460
00:20:52,010 --> 00:20:53,550
Pingjun is so close to you.

461
00:20:54,310 --> 00:20:57,250
She must tell you everything, right?

462
00:20:58,850 --> 00:20:59,660
Yes.

463
00:21:00,070 --> 00:21:02,110
Pingjun and I have depended on each other
since she was little.

464
00:21:02,110 --> 00:21:03,380
Big or small,

465
00:21:03,380 --> 00:21:04,790
she tells me everything.

466
00:21:07,980 --> 00:21:08,580
By the way,

467
00:21:09,380 --> 00:21:10,500
I still don't know

468
00:21:11,180 --> 00:21:12,710
what made Pingjun fall ill.

469
00:21:13,850 --> 00:21:15,160
I heard

470
00:21:16,460 --> 00:21:18,190
she didn't come back all night.

471
00:21:22,720 --> 00:21:24,850
Pingjun told me about this.

472
00:21:25,550 --> 00:21:27,850
A few days ago,
the costumes weren't ready,

473
00:21:27,850 --> 00:21:29,810
and the troupe changed the program
at the last minute.

474
00:21:29,810 --> 00:21:31,670
They urgently needed the lyrics.

475
00:21:31,920 --> 00:21:34,160
She had to work through the night.

476
00:21:38,660 --> 00:21:40,060
That really wasn't easy.

477
00:21:41,200 --> 00:21:42,550
She worked so hard.

478
00:21:53,050 --> 00:21:54,850
This steamed bun smells so good.

479
00:21:55,050 --> 00:21:56,050
What is it made of?

480
00:21:56,510 --> 00:21:58,510
Is this your first time seeing this?

481
00:21:58,660 --> 00:22:00,060
This is not a steamed bun.

482
00:22:00,250 --> 00:22:02,830
It's a wotou, steamed from cornmeal.

483
00:22:05,050 --> 00:22:06,850
Seeing Pingjun enjoy it so much,

484
00:22:07,070 --> 00:22:08,330
I'd like to try one too.

485
00:22:08,680 --> 00:22:09,420
Go ahead.

486
00:22:34,510 --> 00:22:36,740
Mr. Yu, are you choking?

487
00:22:40,810 --> 00:22:42,070
Quick, have some soup.

488
00:22:49,460 --> 00:22:50,390
Feeling better?

489
00:23:03,940 --> 00:23:05,480
Well, Fifth Young Master Yu?

490
00:23:05,480 --> 00:23:06,510
Still choking?

491
00:23:07,290 --> 00:23:08,550
What do you want to say?

492
00:23:11,070 --> 00:23:12,310
What I want to say is,

493
00:23:13,270 --> 00:23:15,160
since we are from different worlds,

494
00:23:15,160 --> 00:23:16,980
it's better not to associate
with each other.

495
00:23:16,980 --> 00:23:18,110
But I actually think

496
00:23:18,510 --> 00:23:20,310
experiencing new environments

497
00:23:20,680 --> 00:23:21,940
and meeting new people

498
00:23:22,290 --> 00:23:23,550
is quite interesting.

499
00:23:24,550 --> 00:23:25,810
Today's conversation

500
00:23:26,160 --> 00:23:27,820
has made me reluctant to part.

501
00:23:28,250 --> 00:23:29,350
Since things between us

502
00:23:29,350 --> 00:23:30,880
have been clearly settled,

503
00:23:31,440 --> 00:23:32,350
I still hope you

504
00:23:32,350 --> 00:23:33,550
can keep your promise

505
00:23:34,110 --> 00:23:35,710
and stop disturbing my life.

506
00:23:41,090 --> 00:23:42,420
Nanhuai City isn't big.

507
00:23:42,660 --> 00:23:44,010
We will meet again.

508
00:23:44,420 --> 00:23:45,220
Please don't.

509
00:23:46,220 --> 00:23:47,480
Fifth Young Master Yu,

510
00:23:47,680 --> 00:23:48,850
I still hope we can

511
00:23:48,850 --> 00:23:50,570
go our separate ways,

512
00:23:50,880 --> 00:23:51,570
and that there won't be

513
00:23:51,570 --> 00:23:54,430
the slightest connection between us
in the future.

514
00:24:05,770 --> 00:24:07,160
Oh, I'm sorry, sir.

515
00:24:11,040 --> 00:24:13,790
[To Ye Pingjun, personally]

516
00:24:12,750 --> 00:24:13,770
For Ye Pingjun?

517
00:24:16,530 --> 00:24:17,050
Look at the stamp.

518
00:24:17,050 --> 00:24:18,160
It's from abroad.

519
00:24:18,530 --> 00:24:20,520
This letter is from her fiancé,

520
00:24:21,010 --> 00:24:22,220
Jiang Xueting.

521
00:24:22,400 --> 00:24:24,310
They have exchanged letters
for four full years,

522
00:24:24,310 --> 00:24:25,180
one every fortnight,

523
00:24:25,180 --> 00:24:26,710
never missing a single one.

524
00:24:28,380 --> 00:24:29,160
Fiancé?

525
00:24:35,000 --> 00:24:35,940
Don't mention you saw me.

526
00:24:35,940 --> 00:24:37,400
Just deliver your letter.

527
00:24:45,140 --> 00:24:46,380
[I am doing well in Japan,
with no worries about food or lodging.]

528
00:24:46,400 --> 00:24:48,370
[I get along with my classmates.
Teachers also offer guidance and support.]

529
00:24:50,510 --> 00:24:51,220
Pingjun.

530
00:24:52,220 --> 00:24:54,150
What did Xueting say in his letter?

531
00:24:55,350 --> 00:24:56,660
He said everything is fine

532
00:24:56,660 --> 00:24:58,090
and you don't need to worry.

533
00:24:58,090 --> 00:25:00,420
He also said he'll be back in autumn.

534
00:25:00,500 --> 00:25:01,240
Really?

535
00:25:01,980 --> 00:25:02,780
That's great.

536
00:25:09,790 --> 00:25:10,480
Pingjun.

537
00:25:11,550 --> 00:25:13,420
That Mr. Yu just now,

538
00:25:13,590 --> 00:25:16,050
he must be quite an important figure,
right?

539
00:25:19,270 --> 00:25:20,660
That surname, Yu,

540
00:25:20,880 --> 00:25:22,270
which Yu is it?

541
00:25:23,550 --> 00:25:26,550
There aren't many people surnamed Yu
in Nanhuai City.

542
00:25:26,880 --> 00:25:28,570
The only one of note

543
00:25:28,900 --> 00:25:29,980
is that family.

544
00:25:30,960 --> 00:25:32,460
Could it be...

545
00:25:34,960 --> 00:25:36,050
Yes.

546
00:25:37,380 --> 00:25:39,110
It's the Yu you're thinking of.

547
00:25:40,750 --> 00:25:42,270
How did you get involved

548
00:25:42,270 --> 00:25:43,510
with the Yu family?

549
00:25:44,960 --> 00:25:46,810
Mother, don't overthink it.

550
00:25:47,070 --> 00:25:47,790
I was working

551
00:25:47,790 --> 00:25:49,250
at Xiangxi Hotel before.

552
00:25:49,500 --> 00:25:50,530
That's where I happened

553
00:25:50,530 --> 00:25:52,190
to meet Fifth Young Master Yu.

554
00:25:56,250 --> 00:25:56,850
Pingjun.

555
00:25:58,220 --> 00:25:59,850
For humble families like ours,

556
00:25:59,850 --> 00:26:00,910
what we seek in life

557
00:26:01,420 --> 00:26:02,510
is stability

558
00:26:02,510 --> 00:26:03,810
and peace of mind.

559
00:26:04,570 --> 00:26:06,030
People like the Yu family,

560
00:26:06,350 --> 00:26:08,150
we can't afford to provoke them.

561
00:26:08,480 --> 00:26:10,380
It's best not to have

562
00:26:10,380 --> 00:26:11,550
even the slightest connection,

563
00:26:11,550 --> 00:26:13,920
or we'll bring trouble upon ourselves.

564
00:26:15,380 --> 00:26:17,720
Mother, I understand.

565
00:26:18,250 --> 00:26:19,850
Now that I've quit my job,

566
00:26:20,160 --> 00:26:20,700
from now on,

567
00:26:20,700 --> 00:26:22,700
I won't have anything to do with him.

568
00:26:22,700 --> 00:26:23,830
Please don't worry.

569
00:26:24,800 --> 00:26:28,920
[Opera World Tales]

570
00:26:28,920 --> 00:26:32,370
[Melodies That Live On]

571
00:26:34,180 --> 00:26:36,470
This letter was sent by her fiancé,

572
00:26:36,770 --> 00:26:37,980
Jiang Xueting.

573
00:26:38,090 --> 00:26:39,830
They have exchanged letters
for four full years,

574
00:26:39,550 --> 00:26:42,700
[Cloud high notes]

575
00:26:40,010 --> 00:26:41,010
one every fortnight,

576
00:26:41,010 --> 00:26:42,540
never missing a single one.

577
00:26:47,160 --> 00:26:48,240
Since things between us

578
00:26:48,240 --> 00:26:49,770
have been clearly settled,

579
00:26:50,270 --> 00:26:51,110
I still hope

580
00:26:51,110 --> 00:26:52,510
you can keep your promise

581
00:26:52,900 --> 00:26:54,500
and stop disturbing my life.

582
00:26:59,350 --> 00:27:00,480
Fifth Young Master.

583
00:27:04,480 --> 00:27:04,920
Why

584
00:27:05,680 --> 00:27:07,560
are you drinking alone?

585
00:27:08,770 --> 00:27:10,480
Speak if you have business,
otherwise get out.

586
00:27:10,480 --> 00:27:11,420
I do, I do.

587
00:27:11,550 --> 00:27:13,610
I have business, good news actually.

588
00:27:15,640 --> 00:27:17,070
Look what this is.

589
00:27:19,660 --> 00:27:20,550
Second Young Lady Tao's

590
00:27:20,550 --> 00:27:22,250
belated birthday gift.

591
00:27:22,500 --> 00:27:24,050
All the paperwork has been completed.

592
00:27:22,820 --> 00:27:24,780
[Land‑Ownership Deed]

593
00:27:24,240 --> 00:27:25,050
Starting from today,

594
00:27:25,050 --> 00:27:26,710
you are the owner of this land.

595
00:27:26,980 --> 00:27:27,710
How about it?

596
00:27:30,650 --> 00:27:33,050
[Seller: Tang Jiqiu] [Buyer: Yu Changxuan]

597
00:27:38,590 --> 00:27:38,990
You...

598
00:27:39,590 --> 00:27:41,940
Do you really just want
to build a racecourse?

599
00:27:41,940 --> 00:27:42,550
Guess.

600
00:27:44,370 --> 00:27:46,350
I guess... I guess it's...

601
00:27:46,380 --> 00:27:47,180
I won't guess.

602
00:27:52,060 --> 00:27:55,150
[Resounding Arias]

603
00:28:10,830 --> 00:28:14,130
[Yu Mansion]

604
00:28:17,250 --> 00:28:17,980
Commander.

605
00:28:18,700 --> 00:28:20,220
Look at your frown.

606
00:28:21,090 --> 00:28:22,030
No more reading.

607
00:28:22,920 --> 00:28:24,750
Soak your feet and relax.

608
00:28:26,050 --> 00:28:26,850
Come.

609
00:28:35,770 --> 00:28:38,050
[Allied Forces Route Map]

610
00:28:43,960 --> 00:28:46,690
The allied forces matter
involves many parties.

611
00:28:46,810 --> 00:28:47,850
Didn't we agree?

612
00:28:48,240 --> 00:28:50,220
No talking about business here.

613
00:28:51,810 --> 00:28:54,280
If you bring up allied forces

614
00:28:54,420 --> 00:28:56,080
or official documents again,

615
00:28:56,420 --> 00:28:57,460
I'll ignore you.

616
00:29:00,960 --> 00:29:01,660
Okay.

617
00:29:02,830 --> 00:29:03,480
I won't.

618
00:29:04,790 --> 00:29:06,000
That's right.

619
00:29:07,270 --> 00:29:08,730
Nothing is more important

620
00:29:09,140 --> 00:29:09,830
than letting you

621
00:29:09,830 --> 00:29:11,250
have a peaceful sleep.

622
00:29:13,480 --> 00:29:14,340
Here, this one.

623
00:29:17,400 --> 00:29:18,060
There we go.

624
00:29:20,920 --> 00:29:21,750
Take care.

625
00:29:28,280 --> 00:29:32,320
[The actual route follows
the Weiling Mountain path]

626
00:29:43,980 --> 00:29:45,440
I knew you'd still be here.

627
00:29:47,850 --> 00:29:49,510
Third Madam, this crabapple—

628
00:29:49,700 --> 00:29:51,880
it's only been a few days
since you took it from me,

629
00:29:51,880 --> 00:29:53,850
and you're already sending it back?

630
00:29:53,850 --> 00:29:55,070
Don't make fun of me.

631
00:29:56,140 --> 00:29:57,400
It was fine yesterday,

632
00:29:58,480 --> 00:30:00,010
but it wilted this morning.

633
00:30:05,350 --> 00:30:06,210
Too much water.

634
00:30:06,700 --> 00:30:07,830
The roots are suffocating

635
00:30:07,830 --> 00:30:08,890
and can't breathe.

636
00:30:09,270 --> 00:30:10,880
Good thing you brought it in time.

637
00:30:10,880 --> 00:30:12,210
Leave it with me for now.

638
00:30:12,220 --> 00:30:13,420
When it's recovered,

639
00:30:13,530 --> 00:30:14,590
you can come get it.

640
00:30:16,900 --> 00:30:18,330
Newspapers!

641
00:30:18,590 --> 00:30:20,530
Newspapers for sale!

642
00:30:21,570 --> 00:30:22,940
Let us cut to the chase.

643
00:30:23,880 --> 00:30:25,250
You have obtained the land

644
00:30:25,250 --> 00:30:26,270
at Changping Mountain.

645
00:30:26,270 --> 00:30:27,530
Your goal is achieved.

646
00:30:27,750 --> 00:30:28,410
From now on,

647
00:30:28,480 --> 00:30:29,980
stop pestering Ziyi.

648
00:30:32,250 --> 00:30:33,980
Why would you say that, Mr. Tao?

649
00:30:35,380 --> 00:30:37,640
I genuinely want to be friends with Ziyi.

650
00:30:39,270 --> 00:30:41,740
Everyone knows Fifth Young Master Yu

651
00:30:42,510 --> 00:30:45,010
is a regular at pleasure houses
and opera theatres.

652
00:30:45,010 --> 00:30:46,180
Your sweet talk

653
00:30:46,500 --> 00:30:47,200
might fool

654
00:30:47,200 --> 00:30:48,700
my naive daughter,

655
00:30:49,680 --> 00:30:51,410
but talking sincerity with me—

656
00:30:51,750 --> 00:30:52,880
do you even have any?

657
00:30:59,250 --> 00:31:00,380
Sincere or not,

658
00:31:00,980 --> 00:31:02,440
words alone mean nothing.

659
00:31:07,720 --> 00:31:09,120
Take a look at this first.

660
00:31:10,970 --> 00:31:11,410
[Account Records]

661
00:31:11,410 --> 00:31:11,670
[Purpose: Special Military
Procurement Fund]

662
00:31:11,690 --> 00:31:12,030
[Amount: 200,000 Silver Dollars]

663
00:31:12,150 --> 00:31:13,680
[Account Records]

664
00:31:18,560 --> 00:31:18,980
[Purpose: Ministry of Finance
Temporary Revolving Fund]

665
00:31:19,010 --> 00:31:19,450
[Actual Use: Converted to USD
and wired to Jincheng Bank]

666
00:31:19,730 --> 00:31:20,090
[Account Records]

667
00:31:21,310 --> 00:31:22,810
Where did you get this?

668
00:31:23,070 --> 00:31:25,000
Where it came from doesn't matter.

669
00:31:25,810 --> 00:31:26,720
What matters is

670
00:31:28,010 --> 00:31:29,410
the same documents exist

671
00:31:30,770 --> 00:31:32,610
in Mu Linsen's hands as well.

672
00:31:34,500 --> 00:31:36,070
Mr. Tao, your business

673
00:31:36,160 --> 00:31:37,530
has grown so much over the years,

674
00:31:37,530 --> 00:31:39,130
so mistakes are inevitable.

675
00:31:39,240 --> 00:31:40,270
But this Mu Linsen

676
00:31:40,880 --> 00:31:42,240
has been secretly collecting

677
00:31:42,240 --> 00:31:44,440
evidence that could cost you your life.

678
00:31:45,640 --> 00:31:47,570
Do you think he intends to help you,

679
00:31:48,720 --> 00:31:50,880
or to hold you at his mercy?

680
00:31:53,770 --> 00:31:54,720
Yu Changxuan.

681
00:31:56,380 --> 00:31:57,880
You're impressive.

682
00:31:58,140 --> 00:32:00,480
I've underestimated you all along.

683
00:32:00,920 --> 00:32:02,380
You flatter me, Mr. Tao.

684
00:32:02,740 --> 00:32:05,010
You have helmed the financial world
for decades.

685
00:32:05,010 --> 00:32:06,270
I speak plainly today,

686
00:32:06,980 --> 00:32:08,840
seeking long‑term cooperation.

687
00:32:09,610 --> 00:32:12,180
Mu Linsen and I have been associates
for years,

688
00:32:12,180 --> 00:32:14,310
yet he still stabbed me in the back.

689
00:32:14,770 --> 00:32:16,640
How can I trust you?

690
00:32:18,810 --> 00:32:20,010
Friendships change.

691
00:32:21,000 --> 00:32:22,060
Interests endure.

692
00:32:22,440 --> 00:32:24,070
Dongze and Beihai,

693
00:32:24,640 --> 00:32:26,030
the two largest docks,

694
00:32:26,830 --> 00:32:29,030
will be fully managed by the Tao family.

695
00:32:29,220 --> 00:32:31,570
All profits go to you.

696
00:32:32,010 --> 00:32:33,270
As long as it's within the territory

697
00:32:33,270 --> 00:32:34,920
under Yu Army's jurisdiction,

698
00:32:34,920 --> 00:32:37,330
whether banks, docks,

699
00:32:37,680 --> 00:32:38,810
or postal services,

700
00:32:40,240 --> 00:32:42,770
the Tao family will have
the highest priority

701
00:32:42,980 --> 00:32:45,310
and the most favorable operating rights.

702
00:32:47,220 --> 00:32:47,940
And this?

703
00:32:48,510 --> 00:32:49,070
Take it.

704
00:32:52,180 --> 00:32:54,380
You really understand mutual benefit.

705
00:32:55,030 --> 00:32:56,180
From now on,

706
00:32:56,720 --> 00:32:59,050
no matter how the Yu
and Mu families clash,

707
00:32:59,830 --> 00:33:01,480
you can balance both sides

708
00:33:02,330 --> 00:33:04,190
and keep yourself out of trouble.

709
00:33:04,510 --> 00:33:06,710
The younger generation is formidable.

710
00:33:09,720 --> 00:33:11,880
However, there is one thing

711
00:33:13,270 --> 00:33:14,380
that must be

712
00:33:15,110 --> 00:33:17,110
the foundation of our cooperation.

713
00:33:17,830 --> 00:33:18,570
Go ahead.

714
00:33:19,440 --> 00:33:20,790
My daughter Ziyi

715
00:33:20,920 --> 00:33:21,790
has been the apple of my eye

716
00:33:21,790 --> 00:33:23,110
since she was a child.

717
00:33:23,110 --> 00:33:25,170
She's never suffered any grievance.

718
00:33:25,310 --> 00:33:26,030
You must not

719
00:33:26,740 --> 00:33:28,200
let her down in the future.

720
00:33:33,030 --> 00:33:33,980
Of course.

721
00:33:38,220 --> 00:33:39,440
The Chu and Yu families have set

722
00:33:39,440 --> 00:33:41,700
the date for the official allied forces.

723
00:33:42,110 --> 00:33:42,920
Yu Zhongquan

724
00:33:43,790 --> 00:33:45,190
will depart on schedule.

725
00:33:46,420 --> 00:33:47,820
Which route will he take?

726
00:33:54,060 --> 00:33:56,520
[Take the Weiling Mountain path]

727
00:33:54,980 --> 00:33:56,310
Weiling Mountain path?

728
00:33:59,850 --> 00:34:01,660
This old fox is indeed cautious,

729
00:34:02,530 --> 00:34:03,830
taking a unique path.

730
00:34:05,000 --> 00:34:05,980
Be careful.

731
00:34:06,790 --> 00:34:08,260
Last time, Liao Dongfeng

732
00:34:08,260 --> 00:34:09,389
took the fall for us.

733
00:34:10,030 --> 00:34:11,050
Next time,

734
00:34:11,960 --> 00:34:13,510
we might not be so lucky.

735
00:34:14,440 --> 00:34:15,440
Don't worry.

736
00:34:17,650 --> 00:34:19,590
Nothing will go wrong this time.

737
00:34:21,070 --> 00:34:22,130
Second Young Lady.

738
00:34:31,610 --> 00:34:33,219
When the servants told me,

739
00:34:33,250 --> 00:34:34,540
I didn't believe it.

740
00:34:35,280 --> 00:34:37,290
What brings Fifth Young Master Yu

741
00:34:37,630 --> 00:34:39,360
to stand guard at my door today?

742
00:34:40,690 --> 00:34:42,350
I came specially to thank you.

743
00:34:46,400 --> 00:34:48,730
A bouquet of flowers
and you think that's enough?

744
00:34:48,730 --> 00:34:51,590
Do you know how much that land
at Changping Mountain

745
00:34:51,760 --> 00:34:53,000
is worth?

746
00:34:56,860 --> 00:34:57,800
And with this?

747
00:35:06,340 --> 00:35:08,380
Fifth Young Master Yu,

748
00:35:08,380 --> 00:35:09,690
one moment "darling,"
the next "sweetheart."

749
00:35:09,690 --> 00:35:11,290
Your gifts are quite simple,

750
00:35:11,530 --> 00:35:14,050
either pearls or gems.

751
00:35:14,530 --> 00:35:16,590
I picked this out especially for you.

752
00:35:18,230 --> 00:35:19,760
You and your little lover

753
00:35:19,760 --> 00:35:20,880
spent the night together on a boat,

754
00:35:20,880 --> 00:35:22,300
just the two of you.

755
00:35:22,630 --> 00:35:24,230
I won't let that go so easily.

756
00:35:24,530 --> 00:35:26,400
How was it just the two of us?

757
00:35:26,530 --> 00:35:28,130
Wasn't the boatman a person?

758
00:35:31,340 --> 00:35:32,530
Sophistry.

759
00:35:33,440 --> 00:35:34,670
You think a few words

760
00:35:34,670 --> 00:35:36,090
can make me forgive you?

761
00:35:37,440 --> 00:35:38,690
Forgive me?

762
00:35:39,840 --> 00:35:41,840
The way you say that

763
00:35:43,630 --> 00:35:45,830
sounds like you're already exercising

764
00:35:46,440 --> 00:35:48,100
your rights as my girlfriend.

765
00:35:50,940 --> 00:35:51,690
Forget it.

766
00:35:52,590 --> 00:35:53,850
Fifth Young Master Yu,

767
00:35:54,190 --> 00:35:54,840
one moment it's

768
00:35:54,840 --> 00:35:56,860
a famous female star,

769
00:35:57,170 --> 00:35:57,730
the next it's

770
00:35:57,730 --> 00:35:59,960
a well-behaved schoolgirl,

771
00:36:00,190 --> 00:36:01,110
and then it's

772
00:36:01,760 --> 00:36:04,920
the White Snake and Green Snake on stage,

773
00:36:04,920 --> 00:36:06,880
those clingy female demons.

774
00:36:08,030 --> 00:36:09,360
I can't handle all that.

775
00:36:12,190 --> 00:36:12,780
Second Young Lady Tao,

776
00:36:12,780 --> 00:36:14,360
why belittle yourself?

777
00:36:15,380 --> 00:36:16,860
Mayor Zhang's son

778
00:36:17,190 --> 00:36:18,450
waltzes beautifully.

779
00:36:19,610 --> 00:36:21,510
The bank director's nephew

780
00:36:21,670 --> 00:36:22,650
studied abroad,

781
00:36:23,460 --> 00:36:25,900
skilled at both piano and violin.

782
00:36:26,840 --> 00:36:27,550
These men—

783
00:36:27,960 --> 00:36:29,420
aren't they all your

784
00:36:29,420 --> 00:36:30,480
devoted admirers?

785
00:36:33,110 --> 00:36:35,170
All these young lords and gentlemen—

786
00:36:35,670 --> 00:36:36,930
Second Young Lady Tao,

787
00:36:37,650 --> 00:36:39,310
you handle them all very well.

788
00:36:42,590 --> 00:36:43,150
You see,

789
00:36:44,010 --> 00:36:46,010
I spend my days surrounded by women.

790
00:36:46,340 --> 00:36:46,800
And you?

791
00:36:47,550 --> 00:36:49,680
You spend your days surrounded by men.

792
00:36:49,840 --> 00:36:51,500
Tell me, in this Nanhuai City,

793
00:36:52,570 --> 00:36:54,300
is there a better match than us?

794
00:36:57,090 --> 00:36:58,460
So you're saying

795
00:36:59,150 --> 00:37:01,000
we are evenly matched?

796
00:37:01,510 --> 00:37:02,760
We're two of a kind.

797
00:38:03,550 --> 00:38:04,890
Oh no! Ambush!

798
00:38:05,240 --> 00:38:07,740
[Yu]

799
00:38:10,030 --> 00:38:10,960
Back up quickly!

800
00:38:22,130 --> 00:38:23,460
Protect the Commander!

801
00:38:42,190 --> 00:38:42,860
Commander!

802
00:38:44,480 --> 00:38:45,940
Ruitong, why are you here?

803
00:38:46,000 --> 00:38:48,000
Changxuan sent me to reinforce you.

804
00:38:48,360 --> 00:38:49,780
Go quickly! I'll cover you.

805
00:38:49,780 --> 00:38:50,690
Commander, come with me.

806
00:38:50,690 --> 00:38:51,120
Go!

807
00:38:58,000 --> 00:38:59,150
Throw the grenades!

808
00:39:37,380 --> 00:39:38,040
Commander,

809
00:39:38,550 --> 00:39:41,280
Fifth Young Master is waiting for you
in the tent.

810
00:39:41,360 --> 00:39:41,820
Please.

811
00:39:42,300 --> 00:39:42,830
Let's go.

812
00:39:51,610 --> 00:39:52,740
Commander, please.

813
00:39:58,360 --> 00:39:59,090
Brigade Commander Kuang,

814
00:39:59,090 --> 00:40:00,950
please rest outside for a moment.

815
00:40:01,320 --> 00:40:01,850
Ruitong.

816
00:40:03,050 --> 00:40:04,450
Are you trying to stop me?

817
00:40:04,800 --> 00:40:06,070
Fifth Young Master ordered:

818
00:40:06,070 --> 00:40:06,970
No one enters

819
00:40:07,320 --> 00:40:08,580
except the commander.

820
00:40:09,030 --> 00:40:09,690
Bingwen,

821
00:40:10,300 --> 00:40:11,230
wait for me here.

822
00:40:23,840 --> 00:40:24,300
Father.

823
00:40:45,760 --> 00:40:46,690
This is your favorite

824
00:40:46,690 --> 00:40:47,890
Phoenix Dancong tea.

825
00:40:53,340 --> 00:40:54,090
Changxuan.

826
00:40:55,550 --> 00:40:57,400
I must thank you for saving me

827
00:40:58,130 --> 00:41:00,060
and arranging everything so well.

828
00:41:05,530 --> 00:41:06,460
It was Mu Linsen.

829
00:41:07,650 --> 00:41:08,530
He arranged for people

830
00:41:08,530 --> 00:41:10,190
to ambush you on the road today

831
00:41:10,530 --> 00:41:11,730
and tried to kill you.

832
00:41:12,630 --> 00:41:13,500
Son of a bitch.

833
00:41:16,860 --> 00:41:18,300
How did you know?

834
00:41:20,840 --> 00:41:22,090
There's one more thing

835
00:41:22,090 --> 00:41:23,620
I'd like to ask you, Mr. Tao.

836
00:41:24,650 --> 00:41:26,440
Mu Linsen tried to assassinate me

837
00:41:26,440 --> 00:41:27,460
to obstruct the cooperation

838
00:41:27,460 --> 00:41:29,260
between the Chu and Yu families.

839
00:41:29,280 --> 00:41:30,170
But now,

840
00:41:30,530 --> 00:41:31,990
the allied forces remain.

841
00:41:33,230 --> 00:41:35,340
I want to know his next plan.

842
00:41:37,650 --> 00:41:39,000
No wonder the land in Changping Mountain

843
00:41:39,000 --> 00:41:40,150
went to you.

844
00:41:40,590 --> 00:41:41,500
The racecourse

845
00:41:42,070 --> 00:41:43,150
is just a cover for you

846
00:41:43,150 --> 00:41:44,630
to win over Tao Xili.

847
00:41:45,900 --> 00:41:47,900
Nothing escapes your eyes, Father.

848
00:41:50,340 --> 00:41:52,110
What about those men

849
00:41:52,110 --> 00:41:53,110
in black outside?

850
00:41:55,340 --> 00:41:56,760
They are soldiers from the Cheng Army.

851
00:41:56,760 --> 00:41:57,620
The Cheng Army?

852
00:41:59,090 --> 00:42:00,690
They came from bandit roots,

853
00:42:01,230 --> 00:42:02,630
always driven by profit.

854
00:42:03,130 --> 00:42:05,800
They even fought with us
over Dongshan Mountain.

855
00:42:05,800 --> 00:42:07,130
Why would they help you?

856
00:42:07,130 --> 00:42:08,690
I provided the intelligence,

857
00:42:08,690 --> 00:42:11,050
and Yang Shiying of the Cheng Army
provided the troops.

858
00:42:11,050 --> 00:42:11,820
The two of us

859
00:42:12,260 --> 00:42:14,150
hijacked the smuggled arms

860
00:42:14,500 --> 00:42:15,650
of the Mu and Tao families.

861
00:42:15,650 --> 00:42:16,910
We split them equally.

862
00:42:17,440 --> 00:42:18,900
I did him such a huge favor.

863
00:42:19,150 --> 00:42:19,750
In return,

864
00:42:19,880 --> 00:42:21,140
he gave me some troops.

865
00:42:21,260 --> 00:42:22,790
As long as interests align,

866
00:42:23,000 --> 00:42:24,500
each side gets what it needs.

867
00:42:24,500 --> 00:42:26,440
Whether it's the Cheng Army
or the Northwest Army,

868
00:42:26,440 --> 00:42:27,440
we can cooperate.

869
00:42:38,550 --> 00:42:39,730
It seems

870
00:42:40,050 --> 00:42:41,480
I've been a failure

871
00:42:41,480 --> 00:42:43,730
as a father.

872
00:42:45,030 --> 00:42:45,780
I've never

873
00:42:45,780 --> 00:42:48,190
truly seen my own son clearly.

874
00:42:54,690 --> 00:42:55,500
Tell me.

875
00:42:56,760 --> 00:42:58,000
What is your purpose

876
00:42:58,000 --> 00:42:59,130
in bringing me here?

877
00:43:02,260 --> 00:43:03,000
First,

878
00:43:04,500 --> 00:43:06,500
I hope you cancel the allied forces.

879
00:43:14,650 --> 00:43:16,110
Cancel the allied forces?

880
00:43:20,030 --> 00:43:20,630
Reason?

881
00:43:21,530 --> 00:43:24,060
You agreed to the allied forces
with Chu Wenfu

882
00:43:24,190 --> 00:43:26,190
hoping to leverage his strength

883
00:43:26,820 --> 00:43:29,420
to gain prominence
before Third Master Cheng,

884
00:43:29,550 --> 00:43:30,460
and thereby

885
00:43:31,610 --> 00:43:32,730
enter the power core

886
00:43:32,730 --> 00:43:34,260
of the central government.

887
00:43:35,070 --> 00:43:37,010
Since you see it so clearly,

888
00:43:38,170 --> 00:43:39,380
you should know

889
00:43:40,980 --> 00:43:44,070
that this allied forces is imperative.

890
00:43:44,420 --> 00:43:46,020
But what you don't realize is

891
00:43:46,900 --> 00:43:49,100
that the seat in the central government

892
00:43:49,860 --> 00:43:51,190
is nothing but an empty promise

893
00:43:51,190 --> 00:43:52,390
from Chu Wenfu to you.

894
00:43:57,210 --> 00:43:58,540
What makes you say that?

895
00:44:07,400 --> 00:44:08,170
This is the Huai Mountain

896
00:44:08,170 --> 00:44:09,340
operation plan

897
00:44:09,480 --> 00:44:10,710
and the military reorganization plan

898
00:44:10,650 --> 00:44:10,870
[Suijing Headquarters Draft]

899
00:44:10,890 --> 00:44:15,310
[Huai Mountain Operation Plan]

900
00:44:10,960 --> 00:44:12,800
written by Chu Wenfu
for Third Master Cheng.

901
00:44:12,800 --> 00:44:14,010
Not a single word

902
00:44:14,360 --> 00:44:15,560
mentions the Yu Army.

903
00:44:15,980 --> 00:44:17,960
He's been deceiving superiors
and subordinates alike,

904
00:44:17,960 --> 00:44:19,190
pulling strings behind the scenes.

905
00:44:19,190 --> 00:44:19,820
This way,

906
00:44:20,340 --> 00:44:21,400
he can justifiably

907
00:44:21,400 --> 00:44:22,860
mobilize our elite troops

908
00:44:22,860 --> 00:44:24,260
and claim them as his own.

909
00:44:24,420 --> 00:44:25,480
When the time comes, he will send you

910
00:44:25,480 --> 00:44:27,150
to the front lines to charge into battle,

911
00:44:27,150 --> 00:44:27,900
while he

912
00:44:28,590 --> 00:44:29,920
hides behind the scenes

913
00:44:30,110 --> 00:44:31,090
and reaps the rewards.

914
00:44:31,090 --> 00:44:32,060
[Military Reorganization Plan]

915
00:44:35,090 --> 00:44:37,260
Chu Wenfu's puppet soldiers

916
00:44:37,820 --> 00:44:39,380
cannot help you

917
00:44:39,550 --> 00:44:41,550
realize your political ambitions.

918
00:44:41,570 --> 00:44:42,400
Only by

919
00:44:42,400 --> 00:44:44,130
growing our own flesh and blood

920
00:44:45,130 --> 00:44:47,060
can the Yu Army avoid being crushed

921
00:44:47,510 --> 00:44:48,590
and swallowed.

922
00:44:54,840 --> 00:44:56,420
If I refuse to agree,

923
00:44:58,920 --> 00:45:00,650
are you planning

924
00:45:00,650 --> 00:45:02,300
to keep me here forever?

925
00:45:03,050 --> 00:45:03,550
Yes.

926
00:45:13,820 --> 00:45:15,510
This is the agreement
to cancel the allied forces,

927
00:45:14,810 --> 00:45:15,870
[Nanhuai Army General Command Directive]

928
00:45:15,710 --> 00:45:18,150
ordering all officers and soldiers
to return to their original posts.

929
00:45:18,150 --> 00:45:18,820
And this is

930
00:45:19,170 --> 00:45:19,930
[Nanhuai Army General Command Directive]

931
00:45:19,880 --> 00:45:21,550
the appointment letter
for the new commander of the Ninth Army.

932
00:45:19,930 --> 00:45:22,200
[Letter of Appointment]

933
00:45:22,360 --> 00:45:24,090
Please, Commander-in-Chief.

934
00:45:29,150 --> 00:45:31,840
Appointing Yu Changxuan as

935
00:45:32,050 --> 00:45:33,110
the Ninth Army's

936
00:45:33,780 --> 00:45:34,260
Commander.
